            },
            "chapter": 3
          }
        ],
        "deadline_chapter": 12,
        "status": "open",
        "last_reviewed_chapter": 6
      },
      "P15": {
        "history": [
          {
            "id": "P15",
            "action": "set",
            "deadline_chapter": 4,
            "reason": "明晨干后复验色影、当面告知不过结果并问运水价；第4章要实际答复和工价安排，不能继续留明日再看。",
            "evidence": {
              "chapter": 3,
              "sha256": "c81a946479ad852b4ed4b0caf5135636de5b1caca772c05f1cc5fcfac5c128d9",
              "quote": "那明早就照这样看。别把这条藏在别的后头。"
            },
            "chapter": 3
          },
          {
            "id": "P15",
            "action": "complete",
            "deadline_chapter": 4,
            "reason": "干后明确不过并告知程，另复32；实际询价收两车320文、当日工320清，原约各项已有答案和行动。",
            "evidence": {
              "chapter": 4,
              "sha256": "77dbed9aa4b2bd159af488149f92e74f9c840c8644a5eddb14a35e91cb27eb0b",
              "quote": "这八匹在可继续试的四十匹里，样的颜色没过，整匹没动。"
            },
            "chapter": 4
          }
        ],
        "deadline_chapter": 4,
        "status": "closed",
        "last_reviewed_chapter": 4
      },
      "P16": {
        "history": [
          {
            "id": "P16",
            "action": "set",
            "deadline_chapter": 5,
            "reason": "新产生首批4匹实际在制品，约初十一程到场给干验结果和暂停8组如何再试的安排；不能只添下一张待看纸。",
            "evidence": {
              "chapter": 4,
              "sha256": "77dbed9aa4b2bd159af488149f92e74f9c840c8644a5eddb14a35e91cb27eb0b",
